  "details": "Several worlds have issues with judder of elements on AMD GPUs. I don't know much about this stuff so I'm sure there are many people here who can explain better, but I'm posting this here to maybe, hopefully get some traction to fix it, whether that's world creators, some workaround for VRChat, or even AMD updating their drivers.\n\nThe closer your viewpoint is to the water the worse the effect is. The effect is not seen in the camera unless the camera is moving.\n\nTwo worlds I've recently been to that I've noticed this issue.\n\nhttps://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_ae001ea3-ed05-42f0-adf2-3d47efd10a77\n\nhttps://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_cafbd53d-e98d-4343-9ea5-4745898e4cd3",
